The three graph files in this directory — melspectrogram.onnx,
embedding_model.onnx and hey_jarvis_v0.1.onnx — are pre-trained models from
openWakeWord (https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord), Copyright 2022
David Scripka, and are redistributed here unmodified under the

    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

The openWakeWord source code, by contrast, is licensed under Apache 2.0; see the
project's README, section "License". These models are NOT Apache-2.0.

Consequences of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 that apply to this repository:

  * Attribution: this file and README.md in this directory are the attribution
    and must travel with the binaries.
  * NonCommercial: the models may not be used for commercial purposes. A
    self-hosted home assistant is fine; selling the appliance, or operating a
    paid service on top of it, is not.
  * ShareAlike: adaptations of the models must be shared under the same licence.
    The files here are unmodified copies of the upstream release assets.

The ONNX copies are the v0.5.1 release assets, pinned by size and SHA256 in
README.md and verified by backend/scripts/download_wake_word_models.py.

The embedding graph re-implements Google's speech_embedding module, which is
licensed under Apache 2.0.
